        <h2 id="what-title">Answers from your pages, or a reasoned refusal</h2>
        <p>AnswerHatch reads the pages you publish and answers visitors' questions from them in plain language, at your site's reading level and in your site's words. Answers can link to your forms and help pages.</p>
        <p>A reader can check any answer in one click, and every response takes one of two shapes.</p>
      </div>
